# Beads Through Holly

Beads is the tracker backend. Holly is the agent-facing surface.

Agents in Holly-managed projects do not call backend tracker commands directly.
Use `holly tracker ...` for issue operations and `holly task ...` for lifecycle
operations.

## Agent Commands

Find work:

```bash
holly tracker ready --limit 10
holly tracker show <issue-id>
```

Create or update work:

```bash
holly tracker create "<title>" --type task --priority 2 --description "<context>"
holly tracker update <issue-id> --status in_progress
holly tracker comment <issue-id> --message "<note>"
```

Start a task:

```bash
eval "$(holly task start --id <issue-id> --intent '<agent-intent>')"
# read-only/non-implementation:
eval "$(holly task start --intent '<agent-intent>')"
```

That command uses the inherited Holly session context, records the issue ID or
intent, and posts/verifies intent. With `--id`, it claims the issue, creates or
reuses the adapter worktree, and `cd`s there when eval'd. Without `--id`, it
records read-only intent and stays on the project root. `HOLLY_SESSION_ID` is
shell/runtime-owned and read-only; do not export, generate, or overwrite it.

Finish a task:

```bash
eval "$(holly task finish)"
```

That command lands the committed work on the integration branch, pushes it,
closes the issue through the adapter, syncs tracker state, removes the worktree,
and clears task state.

## Compaction Recovery

Use Holly surfaces only:

```bash
holly task status
holly task resume
holly worktree list
holly tracker show <issue-id>
```

Add durable discoveries with:

```bash
holly tracker comment <issue-id> --message "<important context>"
holly tracker create "<found bug>" --type bug --priority 1 --description "<details>"
```

## Human / Adapter Notes

The Beads CLI and Dolt store remain implementation details that the adapter
uses internally. Humans maintaining the adapter can inspect those tools when
debugging backend behavior, but agent workflows stay on the Holly CLI.

## Validation

Run:

```bash
holly status
holly validate
```

If Holly reports the Beads adapter is missing or unhealthy, fix the adapter
installation before assigning agent work.
